  "description": "This was the first and most detailed of my Console series. I spent far too long on it. Once when I initialy modeled it and again when I started preping it for Sketch Fab and added every game I ever played as a kid to the scene. Feature creep at it's..best? Worst? You decide.\n\n\nAll Box art except the Mega Man 2 30th Anniversary box (i made that one) were made by: https://www.deviantart.com/m4rcusa\nMost Cart Labels from: https://www.deviantart.com/deadly-rhythm/gallery\n\nBoth these artists specialize in Reproduction art, you should check out their respective galleries.",
